  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "The BODMAS rule is given as follows:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/82c3e40a02b8c826e0d868ad0661efd9dcbce5afdb4d9591a54019ab40c8b055.png] \n\nGiven equation: 28 + 12 - 21 ÷ 7 × 4 = 60\n\nNow, we check the options and see which one follows:\n\nOption 1) × and -\n\n→ 28 + 12 - 21 ÷ 7 × 4 = 60\n\n→ 28 + 12 × __**21 ÷ 7**__ - 4 = 60\n\n→ 28 + __**12 **____**× 3**__ - 4 = 60\n\n→ __**28 + 36**__ - 4 = 60\n\n→ __**64 - 4**__ = 60\n\n→ 60 = 60\n\n→ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 2) + and ÷\n\n→ 28 + 12 - 21 ÷ 7 × 4 = 60\n\n→ __**28 ÷ 12**__ - 21 + 7 × 4 = 60\n\n→ 2.33 - 21 + __**7 × 4**__ = 60\n\n→ __**2.33**__ - 21 __**+**____** 28**__ = 60\n\n→ __**30.33 - 21**__ = 60\n\n→ 9.33 ≠ 60\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) × and ÷\n\n→ 28 + 12 - 21 ÷ 7 × 4 = 60\n\n→ 28 + 12 - 21 × __**7 ÷ 4**__ = 60\n\n→ 28 + 12 - __**21 **____**× 1.75**__ = 60\n\n→ __**28 + 12**__ - 36.75 = 60\n\n→ __**40 - 36.75**__ = 60\n\n→ 3.25 ≠ 60\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) × and +\n\n→ 28 + 12 - 21 ÷ 7 × 4 = 60\n\n→ 28 × 12 - __**21 ÷ 7**__ + 4 = 60\n\n→ __**28 ×**____** 12**__ - 3 + 4 = 60\n\n→ __**336**__ - 3 __**+ 4**__ = 60\n\n→ __**340 - 3**__ = 60\n\n→ 337 ≠ 60\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
